661
00:42:56,310 --> 00:42:57,710
Speaker 0: They're kind of going to bounce off, right?

662
00:42:57,730 --> 00:42:58,470
Speaker 0: It's not going to work out to you.

663
00:42:58,470 --> 00:43:04,650
Speaker 1: I really like how they let you encounter a pretty strong enemy really early and get the summon.

664
00:43:05,110 --> 00:43:07,825
