700
00:45:49,970 --> 00:45:51,624
Speaker 1: You find one, like, every few feet.

701
00:45:51,664 --> 00:45:52,410
Speaker 1: there's a fast travel.

702
00:45:52,690 --> 00:45:56,250
Speaker 1: You can fast travel to anywhere you've ever been, like, so easily.

703
00:45:56,654 --> 00:45:57,988
Speaker 1: So you can just be where you want to be.

704
00:45:58,891 --> 00:46:09,365
