705
00:46:10,051 --> 00:46:11,690
Speaker 0: Until then, you got to walk everywhere.

706
00:46:11,890 --> 00:46:14,870
Speaker 0: This game's like, ah, fuck it, we don't even need an item.

707
00:46:15,070 --> 00:46:18,869
Speaker 0: You just, if you hit a checkpoint, you can teleport between checkpoints for free at the end.

708
00:46:19,132 --> 00:46:19,290
Speaker 1: Yep.

709
00:46:20,210 --> 00:46:28,530
Speaker 1: In fact, in the first dungeon, the one they make you go into to sort of teach you what's going on with the rifts, they, there's multiple fast travel points even inside the dungeon.

710
00:46:28,912 --> 00:46:34,149
Speaker 1: There's one right next to the boss door, and then you find the boss key and you're like, okay, I guess I'll just teleport straight to the boss door.

711
00:46:35,135 --> 00:46:35,270
Speaker 0: Yep.

712
00:46:37,412 --> 00:46:46,790
Speaker 0: So, yeah, I don't know how long the game is, because on the one hand, like, it could be that I've only got two more dungeons and then the boss final dungeon.

