743
00:48:58,410 --> 00:49:16,090
Speaker 1: It looks just like The Link's Awakening, though I did notice it actually gets, it drops its frame rate a lot along the way, and I feel like this game will also be released on Ounce, because I feel like it is pushing the limits of what pre-Ounce is capable of doing.

