00:49:28,175 --> 00:49:33,930
Speaker 0: When you log into the Ounce, you're gonna be able, all your digital games are gonna be there, right?

746
00:49:34,231 --> 00:49:40,870
Speaker 0: It's gonna be probably, I would be surprised if it wasn't fully backward compatible with the Switch, so you won't need your Switch anymore.

747
00:49:41,711 --> 00:49:46,109
Speaker 0: And there are just gonna be a lot of games early next year, whenever this console comes out.

748
00:49:46,731 --> 00:49:49,249
Speaker 0: I presume the Pokemon one, which they seem to have leaked.

749
00:49:49,690 --> 00:49:58,930
Speaker 0: Also, I presume, based on just educated knowledge, but not actual knowledge, that Metroid Prime 4 also will be on both consoles.

750
00:49:59,210 --> 00:50:05,929
Speaker 0: Nintendo's done this in the past, where they've had games as recently as Breath of the Wild, which were dual console games.

751
00:50:06,750 --> 00:50:12,989
Speaker 0: And so there's gonna be a bunch of dual console releases, and there's gonna be eventually exclusives.

752
