Speaker 0: But I think a lot of third-party developers making games, just go in the eShop, it's like, as long as the game doesn't require the advanced hardware power of the newer console, why would you make it not work on Switch?

753
00:50:28,890 --> 00:50:30,530
Speaker 0: Why would you make it exclusive to the new one?

